:: OC Rowan Costume Model [nobr]

Today’s class is line readings, with the main benefit being that you are doing in small groups rather than on stage in front of the entire class. It leads to a much more relaxed experience and people are able to goof around and unwind a little. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Julien</span> says this can help with building confidence and starting with a smaller group can help ease their nerves when it comes to performing in front of a larger crowd. While the line reads are being done, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Julien</span> heads to the back to fix up some torn costumes, carrying a large case full of sewing supplies. <br>
<br>
As everyone finishes the scenes they were assigned, people begin to wonder which scenes they should do next and you are somehow elected to go and ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Julien</span>. Heading to the back, you search around until you find him begin a curtain fixing up the seams on a costume that the local school goffer <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Rowan</span> is wearing. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Rowan</span> sees you and smiles, chuckling slightly at the large puffy costume he is wearing, though he is careful not to move. <br>
<br>
/* Maybe a future Avatar with him showing off one of the costumes? */	
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“$Player.LastName?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Julien</span> says, glancing back to you briefly, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“How goes the readings? Well, I hope?”</span> You nod and explain to him that everything is going good, and the class was actually wondering which scenes they should do next. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh? Already done with the originals?”</span> He turns to you happily, slamming the sewing kit shut. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Wonderful! I was hoping to see some of their performances once their confidence has grown! Thank you, Mr. Leighton, that’ll be all for now!”</span> <span style="color:Pink">Without warning, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Julien</span> pulls the large tunic up and off <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Rowan</span>’s body, revealing the boy is just in his underwear underneath!</span> <br>

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Frown",
            Blush: 2,
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "Julien",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Frown",
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "OC Rowan",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Undies",
            Mouth: "Frown",
            Blush: 2,
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Rowan</span> gasps and quickly covers his underwear with his hands, which are a pair of adorable red briefs with rocket ships on them. The underwear mixed with his smaller size makes <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Rowan</span> seem like an elementary schooler.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Julien</span> begins to hang the costume back up as an embarrassed <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Rowan</span> laughs nervously. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I- I didn’t think he would…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Rowan</span> gulps, bright red, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I should go get dressed before anyone else sees me.”</span> He then leaps off behind another curtain where his clothes are waiting. <br>
<br>
You are still smiling at the image as you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Julien</span> return to the rest of the class. A bit later, as everyone is finishing up, you catch <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Rowan</span>’s eye as he is leaving the room. <span style="color:Pink">He blushes once more and gives you a flustered smile. What a cute boy.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Rowan" 2 1>>
<br>
<<include"Attend Drama Finish">>

